es could appear again in a future  Marvel movie plenty of characters have  wielded the Infinity Gauntlet throughout  Marvel's history so there's a ton of  source material for writers and  filmmakers to use if they wish to bring  back the stones if anyone's going to be  the key to the Infinity stones return  there's a good chance is going to be  Adam warlock who has been tied to the  stones since that print debut but  sometime Adam was a primary bearer of  the Infinity stones and the Infinity  Gauntlet but what's more important aside  he has a pretty messy history with  Thanos and to service the Living  Tribunal a cosmic entity that preserves  equilibrium amongst all realities in the  Marvel Comics multiverse the kicker here  both Avengers and Game  this predecessor Avengers infinity war  were meant to include the Living  Tribunal and Adam himself was close to  being included in infinity war so kid  Marv will be saving Adam for phase four  of the MCU in the hope of folding him  into the franchise off the back of these  atomic Infinity stones it seems  plausible Marvel could even bring the  stones back and introduce Adam all in  one movie infinity warren endgame  screenwriters christopher markus and  stephen mcfeely have previously  mentioned that the character can't just  show up from nowhere and Marvel would  have to quote practically make an Adam  warlock movie to bring the character  into the universe but if it happened  that would be an ideal moment to revisit  the Infinity stones even if a solo movie  isn't in the cards for Adam however he's  likely to play a pivotal role in the MCU  moving forward and if the Infinity  stones never appear in the MCU again  which could be the case at least fans  won't lose any more sleep wondering just  what the heck happened to them check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single